Fri Oct  2 13:36:44 UTC 2026 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 1.1.1
  * allow NULL empty blocks in blk2bstr.
- Update to version 1.1.0
  * remove autotools macros and supporting files.
  * clarify the dual licensing terms of the code, include GPL v2
    text.
  * borrow the library features section from the parent project.
  * remove C++ references in the docs.
  * port UTF8 string manipulation modules from bstrlib.
  * add biseqblk, biseqcaselessblk, binsertblk, bjoinblk.
  * add bfromcstrrangealloc, improve bSecureInput, fix bfindreplace.
  * port bSGMLEncode function from bstrlib.
  * fix bUuDecodeEx: prevent OOM and memory leak on malformed input.
  * fix bNetStr2Bstr: prevent OOB read on crafted netstring length
  * introduce fuzz testing of the library using llvm libfuzzer.
  * rename namespace pollution meson option and define in config.h
- Update to version 1.0.3
  * Create a bstring security policy.
  * Use the full project version as library version.
  * remove invalid # chars from documentation.
  * pkg-config should look for headers in include root.
- Use ldconfig_scriptlets macro.
- Run tests
- Adjust License
- Specfile cleanup

